workflows. Run a fleet of coding agents in parallel on any harness with MCP server support.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-07\",\n    \"category\": \"Agent harness\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\", \"Reddit\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"#11 Product of the Day on August 7, 2026\", \"Open-source harness for multi-agent workflows\", \"Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Codex\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Rindler\",\n    \"url\": \"https://rindler.ai/\",\n    \"description\": \"Automation platform that turns websites into deterministic APIs for AI agents. Automates repetitive web work like pulling records, downloading statements, and submitting forms. YC S26 batch.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-07\",\n    \"category\": \"Web automation for agents\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\", \"LinkedIn\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"#3 Product of the Day on August 7, 2026\", \"Y Combinator S26 batch\", \"No website modifications required\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Crew\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/crew\",\n    \"description\": \"A tiny crew of monsters for Claude Code agents - adds character and functionality to Claude Code AI coding workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-07\",\n    \"category\": \"Claude Code enhancement\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"#7 Product of the Day on August 7, 2026\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"BrowserStack Test Companion\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.browserstack.com\",\n    \"description\": \"An AI coding agent built to speed up test authoring and debugging, capable of running alongside tools like Claude.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-29\",\n    \"category\": \"AI debugging tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Agentic AI News\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"BridgeApp\",\n    \"url\": \"https://bridgeapp.ai\",\n    \"description\": \"An AI orchestration layer that connects people, AI agents, tasks, and context in a single workspace to automate the full software development cycle.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-27\",\n    \"category\": \"Workflow orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Barchart News\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]\n",
